","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"With domestic resources, by 2030 Viet Nam will reduce GHG emissions by 8% compared to BAU, in which:\u003cbr\u003e- Emission intensity per unit of GDP will be reduced by 20% compared to the 2010 levels;\u003cbr\u003e- Forest cover will increase to the level of 45%.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe above-mentioned contribution could be increased up to 25% with international support.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe INDC also includes an adaptation component.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248926339,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\"Emission reduction targets in the energy, agriculture, LULUCF, waste and industrial processes by 2030 compared to BAU in NDC 2022 are higher than NDC 2020, Unconditional contribution increased from 9% to 15.8% and Conditional contribution increased from 27% to 43.5%.\""},{"id":248926739,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248926926,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927070,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927433,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"8% (unconditional) up to 25% (conditional) reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario"},{"id":248927608,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"8% (unconditional) up to 25% (conditional) reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario"},{"id":248927751,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"Vietnam commits to reducing its emissions by 15.8% (unconditional) and by 43.5% (conditional) by 2030 compared to BAU."},{"id":248928144,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928329,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928473,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"VNM","country":"Vietnam","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG 